WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.140
A friend asks: «Tu vas
chez Tom ?» You say:

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.310
«Oui, j'y vais».

3
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.540
Word for word?

4
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.800
'Yes, I there go.' Then
she asks about your family.

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.510
You answer: «J'en ai deux».

6
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.730
'I of them have two.' And you already know

7
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.400
one of these tiny words.

8
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.760
It hides inside «il y a».

9
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.280
So why does a French person say 'I there

10
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.400
go' and 'I of them have two'?

11
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.300
In this mission, you'll watch
whole chunks of a sentence

12
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.620
shrink to almost nothing.

13
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.660
Then you'll find the slot where they sit,

14
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.940
and place them yourself in the lab.

15
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.410
Your mission: explain
those two tiny words.
